<ul>
  <li><a href="/alternatives/sortly/">Open-source Sortly alternatives</a> and <a href="/alternatives/asset-panda/">Asset Panda alternatives</a></li>
  <li><a href="/alternatives/netsuite/">Open-source NetSuite alternatives</a> (Odoo, ERPNext) and <a href="/compare/akaunting-vs-invoice-ninja-vs-quickbooks/">Akaunting vs Invoice Ninja vs QuickBooks</a></li>
  <li>Picking a server: <a href="/compare/hetzner-vs-digitalocean-vs-vultr/">Hetzner vs DigitalOcean vs Vultr</a></li>
</ul>
</div></section>
